  "233|f729d74e": {
   "build": "70450",
   "class": "Warlock",
   "differs": null,
   "event": "gossip",
   "isObject": null,
   "mapID": 1436,
   "name": "Farmer Saldean",
   "npc": "233",
   "questID": null,
   "race": "Gnome",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "Rough times, huh, $N? No matter where you turn someone needs help, and my wife and I are no exception.",
   "time": 1792541159,
   "title": null,
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "Westfall"
  },
  "234|eba492ed": {
   "build": "70450",
   "class": "Warlock",
   "differs": null,
   "event": "greeting",
   "isObject": null,
   "mapID": 1436,
   "name": "Gryan Stoutmantle",
   "npc": "234",
   "questID": null,
   "race": "Gnome",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "A foul corruption has crept into Westfall.  While I was upholding my duty on the battlefields of Lordaeron these honest farms were overrun and made into hide-outs for thugs and murderers. The People's Militia needs your help.",
   "time": 1792541277,
   "title": null,
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "Sentinel Tower"
  },
  "235|f83ef93f": {
   "build": "70450",
   "class": "Warlock",
   "differs": null,
   "event": "greeting",
   "isObject": null,
   "mapID": 1436,
   "name": "Salma Saldean",
   "npc": "235",
   "questID": null,
   "race": "Gnome",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "Welcome to our humble abode!  It's always nice to see a friendly face.  And what strong arms you have.  My husband and I are always looking for help around the farm.  Now that most the good folk have left, it's hard to find an able body to help out.",
   "time": 1792541176,
   "title": null,
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "Westfall"
  },
  "237|7ae4f953": {
   "build": "70450",
   "class": "Warlock",
   "differs": null,
   "event": "greeting",
   "isObject": null,
   "mapID": 1436,
   "name": "Farmer Furlbrow",
   "npc": "237",
   "questID": null,
   "race": "Gnome",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "Nothing but trouble in these parts.  I tried to tell that fool Saldean to get out while he still could be he won't hear of it.  But I ain't no fool.  Verna and I are gonna mosey on out as soon as we get this wagon fixed.",
   "time": 1792541046,
   "title": null,
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "Westfall"
  },
  "238|a3fa5a16": {
   "build": "70450",
   "class": "Warlock",
   "differs": null,
   "event": "greeting",
   "isObject": null,
   "mapID": 1436,
   "name": "Verna Furlbrow",
   "npc": "238",
   "questID": null,
   "race": "Gnome",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "Sometimes I think there's a big gray cloud in the sky, just raining down bad luck upon us.  First, we're driven off our land, and now we can't even get out of Westfall.  Everything's a mess.  Something needs to be done.",
   "time": 1792541092,
   "title": null,
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "Westfall"
  },
  "240|3ccc4430": {
   "build": "70450",
   "class": "Warlock",
   "differs": null,
   "event": "greeting",
   "isObject": null,
   "mapID": 1429,
   "name": "Marshal Dughan",
   "npc": "240",
   "questID": null,
   "race": "Gnome",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "Ach, it's hard enough keeping order around here without all these new troubles popping up! I hope you have good news, $N...",
   "time": 1792537909,
   "title": null,
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "Elwynn Forest"
  },
  "241|2823b3ed": {
   "build": "70450",
   "class": "Warlock",
